---
const title = "Look Up | By NateNate";
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>{title}</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .page-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr) 200px;
            gap: 20px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            padding: 0 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .main-content {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 160vh;
            padding: 80px 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;

            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)),
                url('/cosmic-earth-background.png');

            background-repeat: repeat-y;
            background-position: center top;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            background-size: contain;

            border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .frosted-text {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 22px 34px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: white;

            text-shadow:
                0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9),
                0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);

            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 95%;
            z-index: 1;
            isolation: isolate;
        }

        .frosted-text::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -12px;
            bottom: -12px;
            left: -14px;
            right: -14px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);

            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

            border-radius: 26px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);

            box-shadow:
                0 0 15px rgba(120, 180, 255, 0.06),
                inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.02);

            z-index: -1;
        }

        .sidebar {
            padding-top: 80px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            height: fit-content;
        }

        .sidebar-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .sidebar h2 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .sidebar h3 {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .sidebar a,
        .dropdown-trigger {
            display: block;
            color: #e5e7eb;
            margin: 12px 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.85;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: 0.2s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .sidebar a:hover,
        .dropdown-trigger:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            color: #78b4ff;
        }

        .services-container {
            position: relative;
        }

        .dropdown-content {
            display: none;
            padding-left: 15px;
            border-left: 1px solid #78b4ff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .dropdown-content a {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        .services-container:hover .dropdown-content {
            display: block;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
        }

        .subscribe-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .next-container {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .next-btn {
            padding: 14px 50px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .next-btn:hover {
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .page-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 800px;
            }

            .sidebar {
                position: static;
                padding-top: 30px;
            }

            .main-content {
                min-height: 160vh;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page-wrapper">

    <aside class="sidebar">
        <h2>NateNates Workshop</h2>

        <div class="sidebar-section">
            <a href="/">Home</a>

            <div class="services-container">
                <span class="dropdown-trigger">Services ▾</span>
                <div class="dropdown-content">
                    <a href="#">Transcribing</a>
                    <a href="#">Data Entry</a>
                    <a href="#">Websites</a>
                    <a href="#">Laptop Repair</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-section">
            <h3>Subscribe for Discounts</h3>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your email address" class="subscribe-input" />
            <a href="#" class="nav-btn" style="border-color:#78b4ff;">Subscribe</a>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content">

        <h1 class="frosted-text">Look Up</h1>

        <div class="content">

            <p class="frosted-text">
                I know what you might be thinking. <strong>Why should I look up with you?</strong>
            </p>

            <p class="frosted-text">
                I’m here to share my learning experience and to have it accompanied by other people who are curious too.
            </p>

            <p class="frosted-text">
                The world is broad, with so many mysteries and unexplored unknowns. From the stars in the sky to waterfalls hidden behind trees, to the deepest caverns in the sea.
            </p>

            <p class="frosted-text">
                This is a place to look up and enjoy the experience together.
            </p>

            <p class="frosted-text">
                Thanks for reading Look Up! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.
            </p>

            <div class="next-container">
                <a href="/content" class="next-btn">Next →</a>
            </div>

        </div>

    </main>

    <aside class="sidebar">

        <div class="sidebar-section">
            <h3>Top Posts</h3>
            <a href="/post">Celestial Anchor (Orion)</a>
            <a href="#">The Hidden Waterfalls</a>
            <a href="#">Star-Gazing 101</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-section">
            <h3>Subscribe</h3>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your email address" class="subscribe-input" />
            <a href="#" class="nav-btn" style="border-color:#78b4ff;">Subscribe</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-section">
            <h3>Comments</h3>
            <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                "This post changed how I look at the sky!"
            </div>
            <a href="#comments" style="font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 1;">View all 12 comments</a>
        </div>

    </aside>

</div>

</body>
</html>